      "is_oa": true,
      "oa_status": "hybrid",
      "abstract": "Under investigation in this paper, with symbolic computation, is the Whitham-Broer-Kaup (WBK) system for the dispersive long waves in the shallow water small-amplitude regime.N -fold Darboux transformation (DT) for a spectral problem associated with the WBK system is constructed.Oddsoliton solutions in terms of the Vandermonde-like determinant for the WBK system are presented via the N -fold DT and evolution of the three-soliton solutions is graphically studied.Our results could be used to illustrate the bidirectional propagation of the waves in the shallow water smallamplitude regime.",
