      "abstract": "In this paper, an approach based on the generalized (G ′ /G)-expansion method for two nonlinear fractional physical models is proposed to achieve their solutions including three kinds of hyperbolic function solution and trigonometric function solution as well as the rational solution.These relations are the space-time fractional Whitham-Broer-Kaup (WBK), generalized Hirota-Satsuma coupled KdV equations.The fractional derivative in the present work is presented from the Caputo viewpoint, and precise solutions of the stated nonlinear fractional equations are obtained.Also, the generalized fractional complex transform is employed properly for conversion of this equation into an ordinary differential equation (ODE).Subsequently, some precise solutions are obtained.",
